  0.129.0
     [TOOL-SURFACE] * **tools:** optionally start tool calls while the reply streams
     [STREAM-SCOPE+TOOL-SURFACE] * **streaming:** show every complete array item and hold back unfinished numbers in partial tool input
     [STREAM-SCOPE] * **streaming:** drop the redundant iterSSEChunks layer
     [STREAM-SCOPE] * **streaming:** take each string token as one slice in the partial JSON tokenizer
