     [STREAM-LIFECYCLE] * **client:** ignore invalid Retry-After values and validate maxRetries
     [STREAM-LIFECYCLE] * **client:** retry connection errors in the async client and stop blocking in the coroutine retry loop
     [STREAM-LIFECYCLE] * **client:** stop waiting for a retry as soon as the request is aborted
     [STREAM-LIFECYCLE] * **client:** use the default backoff when Retry-After is out of range
